6% of possessions).\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 teams, half_court_shots ~5994-6581\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-067", "score": 0.096, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-067 | Study family SF-APPA-067: TOV_FORCE 3-ply adversarial surviving lift\n- observed_research_question: TOV_FORCE 3-ply adversarial surviving lift\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Raw R1 TOV-force channel lifts survive opponent re-route or PT-shift (R2) and our follow-the-ball counter (R3).\n- observed_result: R1 lifts shrink ~50%+: ORL Banchero/Huerter +8.4 to net +3.7pp; DET Green/Anthony +7.0 to +3.5; PHI Harris/Vucevic +12.0 to +6.0; BOS Holiday/Council +6.1 to +2.8; PHX Booker/Wiggins +14.8 to +7.5; OKC Dort/Coffey +12.0  [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Net lift is model-implied, not observed in the games; R3 often additive surrogate at n<10.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 4 games; 8 offense-defense sides\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-010\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- auto_measures: VAR:turnovers"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-066", "score": 0.092, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-066 | Study family SF-APPA-066: TOV_FORCE matchup decomposition on four playoff games\n- observed_research_question: TOV_FORCE matchup decomposition on four playoff games\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: TOV_FORCE as a top-3 lever can be decomposed into defender x initiator x PT channels with positive matchup lift.\n- observed_result: Team-PT lifts are small (ORL vs DET PNR +1.2pp; POR vs SAS all PT lifts negative, e.g. PNR -4.1pp) while player-channel lifts are large on small n (Banchero on Huerter SPOT_UP +8.4pp, n_def=17 / n_off=54; 