    "controls": "Baseline PULL_UP PPP for each unit estimated from non-failure games in the same season via leave-one-out or pre-failure periods. Additional covariates: game score margin at start of possession, period, seconds remaining, opponent defensive rating, home/away, rest days, and a categorical initiator quality tier (top-3 usage player vs other).",
